 "blockers": [],
 "notes": [
  "The API at api.openligadb.de is public: no login and no API key. It allows 60 requests per minute per IP. Poll get-last-change and only refetch match data when the timestamp changes. Finished seasons never change.",
  "Leagues are identified by a shortcut (bl1 = 1. Bundesliga, bl2, bl3, \u2026). Seasons are identified by their start year (2025 = 2025/2026). Use list-leagues or list-leagues-by-season to find shortcuts. In list-leagues-by-season, resultsUrl has the form /Matches/{shortcut}/{season}.",
  "The website itself is a Blazor/SignalR app (_blazor/negotiate, _blazor/initializers). Match pages render client-side, so match data comes from the API, not the HTML.",
  "search-team-matches and list-matchday-matches share the same URL shape. A numeric third segment is read as a matchday, and text is read as a team-name filter.",
  "Team ids: 40 = FC Bayern M\u00fcnchen and 7 = Borussia Dortmund were used as examples. Get others from list-teams. The get-match example id (66924) was not in the recording and may need replacing with a matchID from list-matchday-matches.",
  "getgrouptable (group-stage tables, e.g. ucl/2025) returned 404 and is not included.",
  "Data is licensed under ODbL 1.0."
 ],
